he following statements is correct?"}, {"y0": 0.3023255815780629, "y1": 0.31686046478821617, "x0": 0.18984962499804034, "x1": 0.2199248118440649, "t": "(A)"}, {"y0": 0.302325581699187, "y1": 0.31696969703158806, "x0": 0.2349624073264338, "x1": 0.37969924439662384, "t": "OUT (SI) = IN (S2)"}, {"y0": 0.3517441865224309, "y1": 0.36482558106477825, "x0": 0.18984962432134864, "x1": 0.2199248111673732, "t": "(B)"}, {"y0": 0.35029069797825674, "y1": 0.3648484849775835, "x0": 0.2349624020360336, "x1": 0.46428571444266314, "t": "OUT (SI) = IN(SI) U USE(S,)"}, {"y0": 0.399709302656152, "y1": 0.41279069719849926, "x0": 0.18984962492285237, "x1": 0.21992481176887693, "t": "(C)"}, {"y0": 0.3981818184023491, "y1": 0.4127906974917046, "x0": 0.23496240020646486, "x1": 0.4680451147058159, "t": "OUT (SI) = IN (S2) U OUT(S2)"}, {"y0": 0.44767441904172567, "y1": 0.46220930225187895, "x0": 0.18984962495104785, "x1": 0.21992481179707243, "t": "(D)"}, {"y0": 0.44767441849047374, "y1": 0.46075581418878997, "x0": 0.2349624020360336, "x1": 0.46428571444266314, "t": "OUT (SI) = USE (S1) U IN(S2))"}, {"y0": 0.5741279071231211, "y1": 0.5886627903332744, "x0": 0.16353383501143495, "x1": 0.201127820063753, "t": "Q.39"}, {"y0": 0.5726509299559039, "y1": 0.589584689009452, "x0": 0.23491009684356423, "x1": 0.8365086152390628, "t": "For constants a \u2265 1 and b > 1, consider the following recurrence defined on the"}, {"y0": 0.5882156247825486, "y1": 0.603784012363189, "x0": 0.23472171037686723, "x1": 0.39501800401222065, "t": "non-negative integers:"}, {"y0": 0.6060606061710974, "y1": 0.6279069762901344, "x0": 0.4417293253704529, "x1": 0.6259398485393217, "t": "T (n) = a-T (=) + f(n)"}, {"y0": 0.6351515153131142, "y1": 0.649709302312441, "x0": 0.2349624121183987, "x1": 0.7687969831196966, "t": "Which one of the following options is correct about the recurrence T(n)?"}, {"y0": 0.6816860466216675, "y1": 0.6962209298318208, "x0": 0.1898496239324484, "x1": 0.21804511272168692, "t": "(A)"}, {"y0": 0.6816860466009913, "y1": 0.6976744184789506, "x0": 0.2330827156951618, "x1": 0.5733082702540861, "t": "If f(n) is n log,(n), then T(n) is e(n log2(n))."}, {"y0": 0.7340116282375473, "y1": 0.7470930227798945, "x0": 0.18984962492285237, "x1": 0.21992481176887693, "t": "(B)"}, {"y0": 0.7339393935978895, "y1": 0.7572674418415567, "x0": 0.22932330596114803, "x1": 0.5507518739730627, "t": "If f(n) is Tugz(r), then T(r) is e(logz(n))."}, {"y0": 0.7892441861565511, "y1": 0.8037790693667045, "x0": 0.1898496239324484, "x1": 0.21804511272168692, "t": "(C)"}, {"y0": 0.786060606335191, "y1": 0.8054545457291304, "x0": 0.23308270704825756, "x1": 0.6917293318615167, "t": "If f(n) is O (noz (a) -4) for some e > 0, then T (n) is Onloss(a)."}, {"y0": 0.8384495267654346, "y1": 0.8534109382126706, "x0": 0.1896788095470937, "x1": 0.2200956270477672, "t": "(D)"}, {"y0": 0.835333029668385, "y1": 0.8558919174968651, "x0": 0.23293689784310406, "x1": 0.5658875496756129, "t": "If f(n) is O(nlog(a), then I(n) is e(nlog (a))."}, {"y0": 0.9460606058697669, "y1": 0.9593939392031002, "x0": 0.1541353369705437, "x1": 0.3984962338314616, "t": "CS, Set-2 - Copyright \u00a9 GATE 2021"}, {"y0": 0.9461136263079483, "y1": 0.9594096293606308, "x0": 0.7537346200363627, "x1": 0.847769137856715, "t": "Page 32 of 43"}]